        "gg9faz1LjPW_text": "<p>I didn’t expect it to work this well!</p>",
        "ggDai0K52CB_text": "<p>Amazing</p>",
        "ggH5wkp2ZYY_text": "<p>Soft</p>",
        "ggJrMhjFkx7_text": "\"My neck and jaw look lifted for the first time in years. Gentle on my sensitive skin, no redness. I stopped hiding from the camera.\"",
