    "gp_section_631342202840220657": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "fb4dc2417413db866a0c5baf2a65406d15b516e412f72daaca8f66403070bcd7_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggDelw7kVYU_text": "<p>Peptides + Low-Molecular Collagen visibly firm and lift, across the face and the neck most creams ignore.</p>",
        "ggIV4nLXhQv_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,250,251);color:rgb(125,31,43);\"><strong>WHY WOMEN CHOOSE NUVIRA</strong></span></p>",
        "ggMrgZOzDS-_text": "Gentle every night",
        "ggWl6ETwx8R_text": "It actually gets in",
        "ggbHbhEM5mw_text": "Wakes tired cells",
        "ggmD09gcab5_text": "<p>NAD+ is the fuel your skin cells run on. It helps them rebuild collagen the way they did at 30.</p>",
        "ggpA3FN6X2N_text": "Firms &amp; lifts",
        "ggpJY7vIy3k_text": "Firmer, lifted skin that finally matches how young you feel",
        "ggvLyQzRaWP_text": "<p>No retinol sting, no peeling, no downtime. Just firmer, smoother skin while you sleep.</p>",
        "ggw6ueKELG3_text": "<p>Most NAD serums sit on top of your skin and rinse off by morning. Ours is bonded to EGF and shrunk small enough to truly absorb, 345% deeper.</p>",
        "section_preload": "true"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-631342202840220657"
    },
    "gp_section_631342465370031089": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "4ba421684b3dd7f0e327bcc100ee52db0e1d46eb79bff007dee43378615a4944_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg7sjJtMFK2_text": "<p>The carrier protein that shrinks NAD so it finally absorbs.</p>",
        "gg8AaIIewzH_text": "<p>Holds 1,000× its weight in water, inside your skin, not on top.</p>",
        "ggAu-nwIF1O_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(246,226,229);color:rgb(125,31,43);\"><strong>THE REASON NOTHING WORKED BEFORE</strong></span></p>",
        "ggBrxZc91xa_srcSet_desktop_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1001/1086/0617/files/nad-ingredients.jpg-2.webp",
        "ggBrxZc91xa_srcSet_mobile_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1001/1086/0617/files/ChatGPT_Image_4_ago_2026_18_56_35_8bed55ff-a5c6-4d9d-a2c7-61283b401cc2.png",
        "ggCxYF-MXLD_text": "<p>Small enough to reach deeper and plump from within.</p>",
        "ggGj30sHXQ3_text": "<p>NAD+</p>",
        "ggKMMyzIp_E_text": "<p>Low-Molecular Collagen</p>",
        "ggKfoZGf3Ka_text": "You've tried NAD. It never got in, and it wasn't your fault.",
        "ggaBdWMbS-g_text": "<p>The cellular fuel that helps skin rebuild firmness and bounce.</p>",
        "gggcXDF4391_text": "<p>Hyaluronic Acid</p>",
        "gglsR2Q2Efy_text": "<p>EGF</p>",
        "gguPX-V49g3_text": "<p>Your skin is a wall, it only lets in what's small enough. The NAD molecule is huge, far too big to pass through. So every NAD serum you've bought just dried on the surface and washed away on your pillow.</p><p>Our Korean lab bonded NAD to <strong>EGF</strong>, a protein that shrinks it small enough to slip through your skin barrier, boosting absorption by a <strong>patented 345%</strong>. For the first time, NAD gets in, down to where your firmness is quietly collapsing, and tells your cells to rebuild.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-631342465370031089"
    },
