        "ggKw2cHtosc_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgba(255, 255, 255, 0);color:rgb(74,58,61);\">Real, gradual results, the honest kind that last. Firmer, smoother, lifted skin that finally matches how young you still feel inside.</span></p>",
