        "gg32b3T_73O_text": "<p><br><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(74,58,61);\">You're covered by our 60-Day Money-Back Guarantee. If you're not thrilled, send it back for a full refund.</span></p>",
        "gg3_72PabO9_text": "<p>Frequently asked questions</p>",
        "gg3m0FXeqjh_text": "<p>Yes. It's formulated to be gentle, no retinol, no stinging, no peeling. Soothing ingredients support the skin barrier. As with any new product, patch-test first.</p>",
        "ggH-p7q059Y_text": "<p>Many notice softer, more hydrated skin within the first week. Visible firmness and smoother fine lines typically appear around 2 weeks, with best results at 6 to 8 weeks of nightly use.</p>",
        "ggQAHHfLPuv_childItem_0": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(36,26,28);\"><strong>How is this different from other NAD serums?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQAHHfLPuv_childItem_1": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(36,26,28);\"><strong>How long until I see results?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQAHHfLPuv_childItem_2": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(36,26,28);\"><strong>Can I use it on my neck?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQAHHfLPuv_childItem_3": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(36,26,28);\"><strong>Is EGF safe?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQAHHfLPuv_childItem_4": "<p><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255);color:rgb(36,26,28);\"><strong>What if it doesn&#039;t work for me?</strong></span></p>",
        "ggVV7k-uhHI_text": "<p>Absolutely, it's made for face and neck, the areas that show aging first. Apply a few drops morning and night.</p>",
        "ggm5d1CLph8_text": "<p>STILL GOT QUESTIONS?</p>",
        "ggwNfavEju-_text": "<p>The EGF used is a cosmetic-grade skin-communicating protein used widely in K-beauty for renewal. If you have a history of skin cancer, consult your doctor before use.</p>"
      },
